         libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxrandr2
Description: native PixelKit still-image viewer
 LiminalView opens still images and browses their containing folder with the
 arrow keys. This package builds the supplied native Linux application with
 its default BPG, JPEG 2000, JPEG XL and SVG decoding features.
